Subject: Libretro dual: harden the own-save exchange (review items R01-R12)
Series-Step: 15/19 (mgba_dual 1.6-os4)
Origin: hanbang (this project)
요약: 각자 세이브 4판 — 실패해도 복구 자료를 지우지 않고, 정말 2P 로 입장했는지 확인하고, 임시 파일 + fsync 로 안전하게 쓰는 등 점검에서 나온 열두 가지를 고침.

Review follow-up for the own-save exchange: the guest core confirms that RetroArch really joined it as player 2 (it
tees stderr through a small thread and looks for the "joined as player 2" line, English and Korean), keeps a checkpoint
after the 2P SRAM stayed unchanged for 300 frames, never writes a guest-owned 2P save into the host's own 2P file, and
writes files through a temporary file with fsync, read-back and directory sync (exFAT through FUSE). Version string
1.3-os4.

